Algorithm credit / upstream acknowledgement
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The grapheme-to-phoneme rules, syllabification, lexical-stress assignment and
the bundled Basque dictionary (eu_dicc.dic) implemented in this package are
derived from the design and linguistic behaviour of:

    AhoTTS -- Aholab Signal Processing Laboratory,
    University of the Basque Country (UPV/EHU)
    https://aholab.ehu.eus/
    https://github.com/aholab/AhoTTS

AhoTTS is distributed by Aholab under the GNU GPL.

This package is an INDEPENDENT, CLEAN-ROOM PURE-PYTHON REIMPLEMENTATION. No
AhoTTS source code (C/C++) is copied, linked, vendored, or otherwise included.
The algorithms were reimplemented from scratch in Python from the documented
behaviour and the public source's design, in the same spirit as the pycotovia
reimplementation of Cotovia. The package contains only original Python code
plus the dictionary data file, which is read at runtime from its on-disk HDIC
binary format.

